  "about-9": {
    "url": "https://nylifecoach4u.wixsite.com/nylifecoaching/about-9",
    "page_name": "about-9",
    "title": "Testimonials | My Site",
    "headings": [
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "\"Natasha knows exactly which questions to ask\"\n\n\"She has emotional intelligence beyond her years\"\n\n\"Sessions with Natasha are the highlight of my week\"\n\n\"...she always made me feel comfortable and safe\"\n\n\"She's also kind and warm and funny\""
      }
    ],
    "paragraphs": [
      "\"Natasha knows exactly which questions to ask\"\n\n\"She has emotional intelligence beyond her years\"\n\n\"Sessions with Natasha are the highlight of my week\"\n\n\"...she always made me feel comfortable and safe\"\n\n\"She's also kind and warm and funny\"",
      "“Sessions with Natasha are one of the highlights of my week. She’s a pleasure to talk to, and often has simple but excellent suggestions on how to make life a little easier.  She listens closely and often quotes me back to myself when we are working through an issue.  She will often pick up and follow up on small comments I make to see if there is a nugget of insight there.  Knowing that she is going to want to hear about my progress to my personal goals helps motivate me to achieve them”",
      "“Natasha is incredibly connected when she’s working with you. She has emotional intelligence beyond her years. When I was working with her she always made me feel comfortable and safe so that I could explore many different avenues. She’s also kind and warm and funny and we laughed a lot during our sessions. I highly recommend working with Natasha if you need to work through some something.. she will surely get you there and do it with a smile💜 \"",
      "“Natasha knows exactly which questions to ask. She can synthesize our conversations and turn my busy thoughts into concrete suggestions and she can always steer the session into a positive direction. Coaching sessions with Natasha help me understand aspects of my life in more depth, so that my life can continue on a productive and fulfilling  route “",
      "Natasha Yerramilli\n\nnylifecoach4u@gmail.com\n\n(916) 969-7945",
      "nylifecoach4u@gmail.com",
      "© 2023 by Personal Life Coach. Proudly created with Wix.com"
    ],
